{
  "facts": [
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "In the supplied before source, ZSTD_compressStream2 initializes a fresh stream through ZSTD_CCtx_init_compressStream2. That initializer prepares a loaded local dictionary and passes the resulting CDict into ZSTD_compressBegin_internal.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":6201,"end_line":6235,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":6103,"end_line":6129,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The streaming initializer calls ZSTD_initLocalDict and incorporates the CDict."},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":6174,"end_line":6180,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The single-thread stream path passes the CDict to compression initialization."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "ZSTD_CCtx_loadDictionary copies nonempty dictionary bytes into the compression context during its init stage. ZSTD_CCtx_refCDict is another context setup route.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":1270,"end_line":1298,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":1308,"end_line":1323,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "When a local dictionary is present, stream initialization creates a CDict. Compression initialization can attach or copy that CDict, or insert its content through ZSTD_compress_insertDictionary.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":1239,"end_line":1267,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":5016,"end_line":5044,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Compression initialization chooses the CDict route or inserts dictionary content."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "Dictionary insertion skips null or fewer than eight bytes. Raw-content dictionaries, and auto-detected dictionaries without the dictionary magic, reach ZSTD_loadDictionaryContent.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":4953,"end_line":4992,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "ZSTD_loadDictionaryContent updates the dictionary window and, when content exceeds HASH_READ_SIZE, populates match tables according to the selected compression strategy.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":4681,"end_line":4687,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":4729,"end_line":4736,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":4749,"end_line":4799,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "The before-source block compressor selector distinguishes ordinary, external-dictionary, dictionary-match-state, and dedicated-dictionary-search modes. ZSTD_buildSeqStore derives the dictionary mode from match state and passes it to the selector on its internal-parser route.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":2990,"end_line":3061,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":3182,"end_line":3184,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The block path derives dictionary mode from match state."},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":3294,"end_line":3300,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The internal-parser branch supplies that mode to the selector."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "alternative",
      "statement": "An active external sequence producer uses a separate sequence path and receives NULL, 0 for its dictionary arguments. If that producer fails with fallback enabled, the source selects an internal block compressor using the dictionary mode; the no-producer branch also does so.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":3233,"end_line":3249,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-860860e3395d8f95d959","start_line":3277,"end_line":3300,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The fixed entry's primary path uses ZSTD_compressStream2 with continue, flush, and end directives, then ZSTD_decompressStream and ZSTD_decompressDCtx for the round trip.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":59,"end_line":137,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":139,"end_line":153,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":185,"end_line":205,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "The entry reserves part of the fuzz bytes for parameter generation and uses the remaining prefix as compression input. Its parameter helper sets compression parameters and may register a sequence producer.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":156,"end_line":166,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":101,"end_line":165,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"This is the complete parameter-setting helper called by the entry."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The audited entry body has no explicit dictionary-load or CDict-reference call for either context. The complete FUZZ_setRandomParameters helper likewise makes no dictionary-load call. This absence is limited to those two audited units.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":1,"end_line":218,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-d12ebcf33fdbb6d713f7","start_line":101,"end_line":165,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The complete called helper sets parameters and sequence-producer state without loading a dictionary."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": true,
      "audited_unit_ids": ["u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","u-d12ebcf33fdbb6d713f7"]
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The helper file contains FUZZ_train, which can produce dictionary bytes, but the audited entry never calls it. The entry also invokes FUZZ_SEQ_PROD_SETUP; its expansion is not established by the supplied numbered evidence.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":167,"end_line":207,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":1,"end_line":218,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The complete entry shows its calls, including FUZZ_SEQ_PROD_SETUP and no FUZZ_train call."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": true,
      "audited_unit_ids": ["u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085"]
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "The entry's existing checks require successful streaming calls, completed decompression, regenerated size equal to the input size, and byte equality for both streaming and in-place decompression.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":81,"end_line":128,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":148,"end_line":152,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":185,"end_line":205,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-a7cd9e43defd8d40468a","start_line":40,"end_line":47,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The assertion macros abort on a false check or ZSTD error."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The supplied build recipe enters tests/fuzz and invokes fuzz.py build all. It supplies no target-specific dictionary setup in the recipe itself.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6","start_line":1,"end_line":34,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
